%% SECTION S — COMPREHENSIVE WRITTEN SUMMARY REPORT
%%
%% PURPOSE
%% -------
%% Generates a fully formatted plain-text report (kick_drift_report.txt)
%% that consolidates all key numerical results, parameter settings, figure
%% inventory, and physical interpretations into one readable document.
%%
%% The report is structured as follows:
%%
%% HEADER — Title, date/time, MATLAB version.
